<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Services' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <div class="container-fluid service-bg-image">
        <div class="jumbotron text-center">
            <div class="overlay"></div>
            <div class="jumbotron-content" data-aos="fade-up">
                <h1 class="display-1">Craftsmanship Beyond Compare</h1>
                <h5>
                    "Our attention to detail is what sets us apart in every project we undertake."
                </h5>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Gallery Slider -->
    <div class="container-fluid service-gallery p-4">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="swiper-container gallery-swiper">
                <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <div class="text-center p-2">
                            <img src="/asset/building.jpg" class="rounded-circle mb-3 shadow-sm" alt="Building" height="100" width="100" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <div class="text-center p-2">
                            <img src="/asset/building2.jpg" class="rounded-circle mb-3 shadow-sm" alt="Building 2" height="100" width="100" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <div class="text-center p-2">
                            <img src="/asset/building3.jpg" class="rounded-circle mb-3 shadow-sm" alt="Building 3" height="100" width="100" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <div class="text-center p-2">
                            <img src="/asset/construction1.jpeg" class="rounded-circle mb-3 shadow-sm" alt="Construction" height="100" width="100" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <div class="text-center p-2">
                            <img src="/asset/cons.jpg" class="rounded-circle mb-3 shadow-sm" alt="Site" height="100" width="100" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <div class="text-center p-2">
                            <img src="/asset/Clock-Tower_Ludhiana-Flyover-630x1000.jpg" class="rounded-circle mb-3 shadow-sm" alt="Ludhiana Flyover" height="100" width="100" style="object-fit: cover;">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Services Container -->
    <div class="container-fluid service-container py-5">
        <h3 class="text-center mb-5">We Provide Services</h3>
        <div class="container">
            <!-- Home -->
            <div class="row section align-items-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="col-md-4 image-1 order-md-1 order-1 mb-4 mb-md-0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-8 order-md-2 order-2">
                    <h3>Home Construction</h3>
                    <p>
                        JD Builders specializes in constructing high-quality homes that combine modern design with functional
                        living spaces. Known for their attention to detail and commitment to excellence, JD Builders ensures
                        each project meets the highest standards of craftsmanship and durability. They offer personalized
                        services, working closely with clients to understand their needs and preferences, resulting in custom
                        homes that reflect individual lifestyles. With a team of experienced professionals led by Mr. Deepak
                        Kumar, JD Builders leverages advanced construction techniques and materials to deliver sustainable and
                        aesthetically pleasing homes. Their expertise spans from initial planning to final execution, ensuring a
                        seamless and satisfying building experience.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Commercial -->
            <div class="row section align-items-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="col-md-4 image-2 order-md-2 order-1 mb-4 mb-md-0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-8 order-md-1 order-2">
                    <h3>Commercial Buildings</h3>
                    <p>
                        JD Builders specializes in the construction of commercial buildings, providing comprehensive services
                        from planning and design to execution and finishing. Their expertise includes office complexes, retail
                        spaces, and industrial structures, ensuring each project meets stringent quality standards and client
                        specifications. Leveraging advanced construction techniques and sustainable practices, JD Builders
                        delivers efficient and aesthetically pleasing commercial properties. Their experienced team, led by Mr.
                        Deepak Kumar, emphasizes structural integrity, functionality, and timely completion, making them a
                        trusted choice in the commercial construction sector in Ludhiana.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Hospital -->
            <div class="row section align-items-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="col-md-4 image-3 order-md-1 order-1 mb-4 mb-md-0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-8 order-md-2 order-2">
                    <h3>Hospitals & Healthcare Facilities</h3>
                    <p>
                        JD Builders specializes in constructing state-of-the-art hospital facilities. With a focus on quality and
                        innovation, we deliver customized healthcare solutions that meet the highest standards of safety and
                        functionality. Our experienced team ensures seamless project management, from design to completion,
                        incorporating advanced medical technologies and sustainable practices. Trust JD Builders to create
                        modern, efficient, and patient-centered hospital environments that support excellent healthcare delivery.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Flyover -->
            <div class="row section align-items-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="col-md-4 image-4 order-md-2 order-1 mb-4 mb-md-0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-8 order-md-1 order-2">
                    <h3>Flyover & Civil Infrastructure</h3>
                    <p>
                        JD Builders specializes in constructing flyovers, leveraging advanced engineering techniques and
                        innovative design principles. They focus on ensuring structural integrity, durability, and safety, meeting
                        stringent industry standards. Their projects incorporate sustainable materials and efficient construction
                        practices, minimizing environmental impact. JD Builders' experienced team, led by Mr. Deepak Kumar,
                        ensures meticulous planning and execution, delivering projects on time and within budget. Their
                        comprehensive approach includes site analysis, detailed project planning, and precise execution,
                        resulting in high-quality flyovers that enhance urban infrastructure and connectivity.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Helipads -->
            <div class="row section align-items-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="col-md-4 image-5 order-md-1 order-1 mb-4 mb-md-0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-8 order-md-2 order-2">
                    <h3>HELIPADS</h3>
                    <p>
                        JD Builders specializes in the construction of helipads, delivering top-tier services tailored to meet
                        stringent aviation standards. With a team of experienced engineers, we ensure robust design, precise
                        execution, and safety compliance. Our services encompass site assessment, structural design, material
                        selection, and finishing touches. Whether for commercial, residential, or emergency use, JD Builders
                        guarantees a durable, reliable, and efficient helipad solution, backed by years of expertise in the
                        construction industry.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
